    <briefdescription>
<para>The state of one LING run: the files, the message, and the watcher of the file folders. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The model reads the manifest path from its state, and it replaces the files child with the rows of the manifest. Each folder of a file row is watched. A change of a watched file sends a path change for its row. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
